WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:05,670
Lin Yu, you're not really guilty of anything, are you?

2
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:09,250
Why are the police looking for you every two days?

3
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:13,570
I am Liang Min, but I am Boss Wang. Business has not been very good recently.

4
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:16,620
Why don't you look happy at all?

5
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:19,620
Take care of yourself first, don’t even know if it goes bankrupt someday.

6
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:29,270
Why did you go to Grandma Wang's place to eat and drink again?

7
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:31,620
Didn’t you just have breakfast?

8
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:37,700
Moreover, the fish did not eat and drink together

9
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,700
The fish also helps to attract customers
